WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Explore the editable garden-house scene.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Draw a short detail on the front plane.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Select the new stroke, move it, then undo and redo the transform.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Orbit the camera to inspect the drawing in depth.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Save the native document through the production save path.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Reopen the saved native document. The scene remains editable; input is synthetic with no pressure data.
